入了<QUOTEOPEN_0001>代数栈（algebraic stacks）<QUOTECLOSE_0001>。这种栈推广了 Deligne--Mumford 栈（Deligne-Mumford stacks），如今通常称为<EMPHOPEN_0001>Artin 栈（Artin stacks）<EMPHCLOSE_0001>；它们具有可表对角态射（representable diagonal），并允许概形给出的光滑表示（smooth presentations by schemes）。论文还给出了称为 Artin 判据（Artin's criterion）的形变理论判据（deformation-theoretic criterion）。借助这一判据，无须显式给出一个表示（a presentation），便可证明给定的模栈（a given moduli stack）是 Artin 栈（an Artin stack）。", "translation_hash": "sha256:349bda7baf250745a81a59d9c4883d1bd8a914e40709f4feb8471a90237b2de9", "unit_id": "tag:03B2:item003-quote", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "Artin 论文引入并推广 Deligne--Mumford 栈的对象。", "source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数栈"}, {"context": "Artin 栈所推广的栈类。", "source_term": "Deligne-Mumford stacks", "target_term": "Deligne--Mumford 栈"}, {"context": "这类代数栈如今的通称。", "source_term": "Artin stacks", "target_term": "Artin 栈"}, {"context": "Artin 栈的条件之一。", "source_term": "representable diagonal", "target_term": "可表对角态射"}, {"context": "Artin 栈所允许的表示。", "source_term": "smooth presentations by schemes", "target_term": "概形给出的光滑表示"}, {"context": "论文给出的形变理论判据的名称。", "source_term": "Artin's criterion", "target_term": "Artin 判据"}, {"context": "用于判定模栈为 Artin 栈的判据。", "source_term": "deformation-theoretic criterion", "target_term": "形变理论判据"}, {"context": "运用 Artin 判据时无须显式给出的数据。", "source_term": "a presentation", "target_term": "表示"}, {"context": "应用 Artin 判据所考察的对象。", "source_term": "a given moduli stack", "target_term": "给定的模栈"}, {"context": "借助该判据可证明的结论。", "source_term": "an Artin stack", "target_term": "Artin 栈"}]}
